This page compares zanity with [nouls](https://github.com/benomahony/nouls) on the same source files.
Generated by `bench/parity/parity.py` on 2026-10-18, against zanity `68a6651`.

# Inference

nouls asks a model 30 named questions and one question per error-catalogue family, 475 in all. The list comes from nouls' own config loader.

